    <Fragment set:html={`<main id="content" class="site-main post-22 page type-page status-publish hentry"><div class="page-content"><div data-elementor-type="wp-page" data-elementor-id="22" class="elementor elementor-22" data-elementor-post-type="page"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2c3e4a49 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="2c3e4a49" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6e991425 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child" data-id="6e991425" data-element_type="container"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-11b15f34 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="11b15f34" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Welcome to</h2></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1f308d00 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="1f308d00" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"> <img class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-1662 " src="/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/fwf-white-construction-logo.webp" decoding="async" width="714" height="172"   alt="" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/fwf-white-construction-logo.webp 714w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/06/fwf-white-construction-logo-300x72.webp 300w" sizes="(max-width: 714px) 100vw, 714px" /></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-31a78f2e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="31a78f2e" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><h1 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Where it all began</h1></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-309b5cfa e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="309b5cfa" data-element_type="container"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-599c4170 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="599c4170" data-element_type="container"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5d8db53 e-flex e-con-boxed elementor-invisible e-con e-child" data-id="5d8db53" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInRight&quot;}"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-859f216 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="859f216" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Who We Are</h2></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4c8ecede elementor-hidden-mobile elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="4c8ecede" data-element_type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInLeft&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:250}" data-widget_type="image.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"> <img class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-1776 " src="/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Group-photo-against-blue-backdrop-1024x683.png" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="800" height="534"   alt="" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Group-photo-against-blue-backdrop-1024x683.png 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Group-photo-against-blue-backdrop-300x200.png 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Group-photo-against-blue-backdrop-768x512.png 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Group-photo-against-blue-backdrop.png 1536w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" /></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1a8db5d e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="1a8db5d" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;animation_mobile&quot;:&quot;fadeInRight&quot;}"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2465c150 elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="2465c150" data-element_type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInRight&quot;,&quot;_animation_mobile&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><p>Our journey began with Roz. With over 20 years of experience at the helm of large corporate finance teams. Roz’ interest grew after following in her fathers footsteps and joined the family business, which led to a training contract with a Top 10 accountancy practice and became ACA qualified.</p><p>Four years in audit gave a solid grounding for her future career, working across a range of different sized businesses and industries.. Key clients during this time included a £500m revenue construction group, listed entities and family run businesses and has since covered a range of entities from £1bn revenue to PE backed start-ups and turnaround situations.</p><p>This path ultimately led her to the realisation that her knowledge and expertise could have a profound impact with SME businesses seeking to thrive and flourish with a full finance team functionality, which would not be possible to access with in-house personnel.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-363270e9 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent" data-id="363270e9" data-element_type="container"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-51dace7f e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="51dace7f" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9ea6d70 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="9ea6d70" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-842aad3 e-flex e-con-boxed elementor-invisible e-con e-child" data-id="842aad3" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInRight&quot;}"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1332083e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="1332083e" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Meet Roz</h2></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5d7df652 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child" data-id="5d7df652" data-element_type="container"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-672f7cdb elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="672f7cdb" data-element_type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInRight&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:250}" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><p>Roz never saw herself as an accountant….. a mad scientist, a translator traveling the globe, an astronaut perhaps but not an accountant.</p><p>However, after graduating and returning home for the summer she decided the family business needed some organising….Roz took on all the ‘back office’ tasks of finance, IT, HR and found her calling in Finance.</p><p>She qualified in audit and moved to various roles in industry working for a wide variety of companies in the construction, property development and marine engineering sectors from start-ups to private equity to £1 billion turnover main contractors, managing whole finance teams.</p></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-d739b9e elementor-widget elementor-widget-button" data-id="d739b9e" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="button.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><div class="elementor-button-wrapper"> <a class="elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm" href="/meet-the-team/"> <span class="elementor-button-content-wrapper"> <span class="elementor-button-text">Meet the team</span> </span> </a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-46af276 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="46af276" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-a89a86b e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child" data-id="a89a86b" data-element_type="container"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2ab6758 e-flex e-con-boxed elementor-invisible e-con e-child" data-id="2ab6758" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInRight&quot;}"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-62989e2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="62989e2" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Our Purpose</h2></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b7126cb e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child" data-id="b7126cb" data-element_type="container"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-93233dc elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="93233dc" data-element_type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInRight&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:250}" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><p>The heartbeat of our mission is to empower individuals and businesses to navigate the complex world of finance with confidence and ease.</p><p>We want to provide knowledge and power to our clients, ensuring that they are able to take back control of their business and move the company onwards and achieve their goals.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-55c9ada0 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent" data-id="55c9ada0" data-element_type="container"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4df73649 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="4df73649" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-312bbdc6 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child" data-id="312bbdc6" data-element_type="container"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1c936f2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="1c936f2" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Our Approach</h2></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-385b995d elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="385b995d" data-element_type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInRight&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:250}" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><p>Our team at Finance with Flow provides clients with a personable approach and a positive can-do attitude and believe that success lies not only in the numbers, but in the people behind them.</p><p>We collaborate seamlessly with your in-house team creating a powerhouse of financial expertise!</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1be1e415 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="1be1e415" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-969e516 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="969e516" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4ba0e33 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child" data-id="4ba0e33" data-element_type="container"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9ad0488 e-flex e-con-boxed elementor-invisible e-con e-child" data-id="9ad0488" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInRight&quot;}"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9fcfe09 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="9fcfe09" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Our Values</h2></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5f0aea3 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="5f0aea3" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5bd7f6b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="5bd7f6b" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1fef61b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="1fef61b" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Making a difference</h2></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-d4ca0bf elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="d4ca0bf" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><p>We will turn finance from an every day requirement, into the bones that support your business.</p></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-a329e10 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="a329e10" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c6fab8c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="c6fab8c" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Positive</h2></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-8444d84 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="8444d84" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"> We are proactive in looking at efficiency and deciphering what the numbers mean in a  real world concept.</div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1db4952 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="1db4952" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5497f2e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="5497f2e" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Trust</h2></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-228fdc9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="228fdc9" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"> We do things properly, we will have honest conversations when needed, and will be with you every step of the way.</div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c376dd6 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="c376dd6" data-element_type="container"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-35e021a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="35e021a" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-efb0005 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="efb0005" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Empowered</h2></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-72a296d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="72a296d" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"> We understand that every business is unique. Our collaborative approach ensures that we tailor our strategies to meet the individual needs and aspirations of each client.</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-62d0c1c3 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent" data-id="62d0c1c3" data-element_type="container"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-52d622c5 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="52d622c5" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1827add5 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="1827add5" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2a3f59b6 e-flex e-con-boxed elementor-invisible e-con e-child" data-id="2a3f59b6" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInRight&quot;}"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-29eca860 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="29eca860" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Our Commitment</h2></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4cd9d2b2 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child" data-id="4cd9d2b2" data-element_type="container"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2e3b7fa1 elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="2e3b7fa1" data-element_type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInRight&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:250}" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><p>Finance with Flow is more than just a service provider; we become a partner on your journey. We are dedicated to delivering unparalleled support, personalised guidance and a roadmap to financial success.</p><p>We create long term relationships by being strong communicators, keeping you in the loop ensuring that you are abreast of all the financial decisions made.</p><p>We are here to help you navigate the financial maze.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-263a9b05 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="263a9b05" data-element_type="container"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6d2c83c1 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child" data-id="6d2c83c1" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-46f005e2 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child" data-id="46f005e2" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-182652e5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="182652e5" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Join the Finance with Flow Journey</h2></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-ba74217 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child" data-id="ba74217" data-element_type="container"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7ed852d elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="7ed852d" data-element_type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInRight&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:250}" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><p>Let’s work together to not only achieve financial goals but to exceed them while staying true to the heart and soul of your business.</p><p>We’re here to help – contact us to today, to discuss your requirements and let’s shape your success together.</p></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e6a1c31 elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button" data-id="e6a1c31" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="button.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><div class="elementor-button-wrapper"> <a class="elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-md" href="/contact/"> <span class="elementor-button-content-wrapper"> <span class="elementor-button-text">Contact us today</span> </span> </a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="post-tags"></div></div></main>`} />
